Z||000002||Slammed Fiero||05-24-2001||04:02 PM||||Still making them , just going to install my set this weekend.Do you want white face or black face?? I'm using an 84 speedo setup , non backlit . I have been working on an indiglow setup for my car with white face , but just haven't had the time to finsh it (Have all the parts) so for now I'm just trying to get it on the road..<P>Let me know what you want<P>Anyone in Canada who wants a full set of white face gauges for a GT , I have them.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
