Z||000005||Huck||05-24-2001||10:23 PM||||Hey Slammed Fiero, I was planning on getting white face guages not too long ago, then my clutch slave cylindar went on me and that was my "Child support payment" for the month to The Fiero Store..  However, payday comes around every 2 weeks..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  If you still have those white face guages, email me with a price and where your from..  I live in Chesley, just north of Hanover / Walkerton Ontario..  If your not too far away I'd cruse to pick em up if needed.<P>Huck<BR>driedger@hotmail.com<P>87 GT T-top||||reg||1
